OL,3,GNEWSAGoogle says services recovering
OL,4,Aafter cloud outage hits UK banks and
OL,5,Awebsites
OL,6,
OL,7,FGoogle Cloud says services are
OL,8,Frecovering after a "power event" at its
OL,9,FUK cloud site caused an outage
OL,10,Faffecting UK banks, businesses and the
OL,11,Fcourts.
OL,13,FThe company, one of a few large cloud
OL,14,Fcomputing firms whose infrastructure
OL,15,Fand services underpin many online
OL,16,Fplatforms, reported an "issue with
OL,17,Fmultiple services" at its London data
OL,18,Fcentre complex "europe-west2."
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
