OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAGoogle says services recovering
OL,4,Aafter cloud outage hits UK banks and
OL,5,Awebsites
OL,6,
OL,7,FRevolut, Lloyds Bank and HSBC confirmed
OL,8,Fdisruption to some services on Tuesday
OL,9,Fmorning, after thousands of reports of
OL,10,Fproblems were raised by users online.
OL,12,FWhile the banks did not directly link
OL,13,Fthe issues to the Google Cloud outage,
OL,14,Fthe company has apologised "to all who
OL,15,Fare affected by the disruption".
